# Raw and processed datasets. data/papers/ and data/processed/ are the
# CURRENT motor-task locations, not yet migrated to data/motor/... (see
# docs/repo-restructuring-plan.md Sec 3 -- deliberately deferred). data/movie/
# and data/structural/ are the new, low-risk skeleton for the planned
# extensions -- empty except for READMEs until real data lands.
